# Headers for the deployed site.
#
# The first two are the reason the page can use every processor core. Browsers only hand
# out shared memory, and therefore multi threaded work, to a page that sends both. Without
# them the site still works but runs on one core and takes about twice as long.
#
# "credentialless" rather than "require-corp" so the page can still load the runtime from
# a public CDN, which would otherwise be blocked.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

# The model files never change without changing their name, so let browsers keep them.
# A visitor downloads them once, not once per visit.
/models/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
